# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Generated code — regenerate with `make gen` (build_runner + gen-l10n); never edit by hand
*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart
*.config.dart
*.mocks.dart
/lib/core/language/gen/

# Signing material — lives in the CI secret store (.claude/rules/supply-chain-security.md)
/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
